\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Children of peace, yourselves example be,
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj Love each other zealously.
\par Peace shall there and then reside in your homes,
\par And your blessings shall be great.
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj In truth, if in our sojourn on earth here,
\par We earnestly show love to each other,
\par Each would accord his neighbour
\par As is appropriate to do.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When you consider yourselves sons of God,
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj And as well humble yourselves,
\par And the Saviour's love reside in your hearts,
\par You shall love each one with zeal;
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj But when someone really show thee true love,
\par You too will love him as a companion,
\par \pard    And together you'll receive perfect peace and happiness.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

